🇷🇺🔹The Russian Armed Forces have struck a cargo terminal called "Nika Terra" in Nikolaev and the surrounding area, as well as logistics centers, including "Metro" and "Nova Poshta," which were being used by the Ukrainian Armed Forces, according to the Russian Ministry of Defense.

Also targeted:
➡️Logistics centers "Metro," "ATP YUTK," "Nova Poshta," "Nikolaev-2," and "Elektrotehnika";

➡️A plant for the production of drones, two warehouse terminals, a substation, and four fuel tanks in the port;

➡️ In Kiev - a warehouse of a company that manufactures unmanned boats and drones;

➡️ In Odessa - cargo ship that was delivering military supplies;

➡️Facilities at the "Starokazachiye" border crossing point, which, according to the Russian Ministry of Defense, were used to deliver military supplies to Ukraine.

